# Keep secrets and local state out of every image built from this repo.
# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`; without this file a local build baked the
# real .env into the image (found 2026-09-21 while verifying the default CMD).
# Render builds from git, where .env is already ignored — this protects
# local/CI builds and keeps images small.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.venv
cortech/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
output/
pending_proposals/
failed_saves/
*.log
dashboard/design/queue_preview.html
# Source documents (460 MB) are not part of either Render service's image; the
# worker drafts without them and main.py --extract-relationships is offline-only.
data/proposals/
data/cvs/
